### =================================================================
### 1-QADAM: SUPER ADMIN TIZIMGA KIRADI
### Maqsad: Token olish. Chunki keyingi amallarni faqat u qila oladi.
### =================================================================
POST localhost:8080/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json
Accept-Language: UZ

{
  "username": "998911576777",
  "password": "12345"
}

